                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Neater than I expected. The animations are based on your gaze meaning the part of the scene you're looking at plays out it's story while the part you're not looking at pauses dynamically. So the main story is about a guy chasing an \"intruder\" who happens to be Santa but all these other apartments have mini stories to tell, as well, and when you turn your back on the Santa story to look at another apartment, you don't miss anything. It will just wait for you to turn back around.\n\nIt's neat for adults and probably great fun for kids right before Christmas.",
